Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.54,0:00:08.77,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,Here it comes. Ready, Ray?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.77,0:00:10.73,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm ready. Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.01,0:00:32.51,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,After the training...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.51,0:00:34.27,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,...comes the protein!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.03,0:00:38.11,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,So you're in two clubs at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.63,0:00:39.52,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.83,0:00:41.89,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I'm finally here at this academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.89,0:00:44.02,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I want to do everything I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.02,0:00:46.88,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,I see, but it's going to be rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.88,0:00:48.46,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.46,0:00:50.89,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I've got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:54.03,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.01,0:01:24.77,Sign_Basic,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(279,1)\an8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\3c&HB25813&\blur3}T{\3c&HB3571A&}h{\3c&HB35621&}e{\3c&HB45529&} {\3c&HB45430&}I{\3c&HB55337&}c{\3c&HB5513E&}e{\3c&HB65045&}b{\3c&HB64F4C&}l{\3c&HB74E54&}a{\3c&HB74D5B&}d{\3c&HB84C62&}e {\fnArial\b1\shad0\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur3\c&HB3571A&}S{\c&HB54F25&}o{\c&HB8482F&}r{\c&HBA403A&}c{\c&HBD3944&}e{\c&HBF314F&}r{\c&HC22A59&}e{\c&HC42264&}r\N{\fnGeorgia\b0\c&H000000&}Shall {\fnArial\b1\shad0\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur3\c&HB3571A&}R{\c&HB94533&}u{\c&HBE344B&}l{\c&HC42264&}e {\fnGeorgia\b0\c&H000000&}the {\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\3c&HB25813&\blur3\c&HFFFFFF&}W{\3c&HB65428&}o{\3c&HB94F3C&}r{\3c&HBD4B51&}l{\3c&HC04665&}d
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.78,0:02:27.00,ep title,Titl,0,0,0,,Episode 2\N{\fscx95}The Boy Who Became the World's Strongest Sorcerer\NBegins His Practical Exercise
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.50,0:02:29.72,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.95,0:02:39.93,Main,Lex,0,0,0,,So you've come.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.59,0:02:42.26,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,My name is Ray White!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.75,0:02:45.77,Main,Lex,0,0,0,,It seems you want to join our \NEnvironmental Research Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.77,0:02:47.22,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,The Environmental Research Club!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.22,0:02:49.34,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,That means we explore the forests,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.34,0:02:52.55,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,the rivers, all the way up \Nto the glacier regions!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.55,0:02:55.31,Main,Senior Club Member,0,0,0,,Those who conduct environmental \Nresearch are fearless!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.31,0:02:56.33,Main,Senior Club Member,0,0,0,,People call us...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.33,0:02:57.58,Main,Club Members,0,0,0,,...hunters!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.58,0:03:01.07,Main,Lex,0,0,0,,We do not discriminate against ordinaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.31,0:03:04.16,Main,Lex,0,0,0,,However, a person with a \Nweak body or a weak mind
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:06.01,Main,Lex,0,0,0,,cannot keep up with the \NEnvironmental Research Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.01,0:03:07.59,Main,Club Member B,0,0,0,,Kinda scrawny.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.59,0:03:09.35,Main,Club Member,0,0,0,,Not enough bulk...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.43,0:03:14.81,Main,Lex,0,0,0,,Clothes off first!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.81,0:03:16.01,Main,Lex,0,0,0,,Then we'll talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.35,0:03:17.93,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.93,0:03:19.51,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Bulk!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.80,0:03:29.20,Main,Club Member A,0,0,0,,Check out that bulk!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.55,0:03:30.41,Main - Top,Club Member B,0,0,0,,I guess he just looks skinny in clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.41,0:03:33.96,Main,Club Member C,0,0,0,,He's huge! So huge he probably has \Nto pay property tax on those!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.96,0:03:35.49,Main,Lex,0,0,0,,Nice muscles.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.49,0:03:36.85,Main,Lex,0,0,0,,They're not just for show, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.85,0:03:39.77,Main,Lex,0,0,0,,You got them by actually using your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.82,0:03:43.61,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I trained in the backwoods forests.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.40,0:03:45.92,Main,Lex,0,0,0,,So it's Ray, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.92,0:03:48.33,Main,Lex,0,0,0,,You have one of these, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.12,0:03:52.01,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,You've got keen insight, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.83,0:03:57.35,Main,Club Member A,0,0,0,,A gold hunter license?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.16,0:03:58.78,Main,Club Member B,0,0,0,,An ordinary with a gold?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.92,0:03:59.31,Main,Club Member C,0,0,0,,Even amongst hunters,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.31,0:04:01.83,Main,Club Member C,0,0,0,,a gold hunter is on another level!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.16,0:04:04.09,Main,Club Member D,0,0,0,,But that makes sense then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.09,0:04:06.38,Main,Club Member D,0,0,0,,That bulk is serious business!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.19,0:04:09.11,Main,Lex,0,0,0,,Outstanding potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.34,0:04:18.34,Main,Lex,0,0,0,,Ray, become a pillar of the \NEnvironmental Research Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.85,0:04:20.72,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,It would be my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.45,0:04:31.33,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.51,0:04:40.83,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Oh, my. Ray?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.75,0:04:43.83,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,You'd like to join?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.83,0:04:44.61,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.61,0:04:47.59,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I am interested in the plants \Nthat are living so powerfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.40,0:04:50.31,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Even in the most appalling environment,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.72,0:04:52.75,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,you can find a flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.88,0:04:56.23,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Even if that's a battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.44,0:04:59.27,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,So you like flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.28,0:05:01.28,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.60,0:05:04.10,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,We don't have any other male members, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.10,0:05:06.04,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Are you all right with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.04,0:05:08.86,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I have no problem communicating with women.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.86,0:05:09.97,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Well, in that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.30,0:05:11.52,Main,Dina,0,0,0,,I object!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.86,0:05:14.40,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Dina?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.40,0:05:17.41,Main,Dina,0,0,0,,He's obviously set his sights on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.41,0:05:20.31,Main,Mokuto,0,0,0,,We can't have a man step \Ninto the flower garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.31,0:05:22.18,Main,Sui,0,0,0,,The flowers would wither.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.18,0:05:24.86,Main,Tenka,0,0,0,,Not to mention, this person is an ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.11,0:05:29.73,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Then, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.73,0:05:32.53,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,I am delegating Ray's case to Dina.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.53,0:05:33.68,Main,Dina,0,0,0,,Me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:34.68,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.68,0:05:37.10,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,If you find that he's \Nunworthy after your evaluation,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.10,0:05:39.12,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,you can reject his application.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.12,0:05:41.20,Main,Dina,0,0,0,,U-Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.20,0:05:42.60,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.10,0:05:44.19,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.13,0:05:47.65,Main,Dina,0,0,0,,My name is Dina Sera. I'm a third-year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.65,0:05:49.83,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I look forward to working \Nwith you, Miss Sera.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.83,0:05:50.75,Main,Dina,0,0,0,,Harumph!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.75,0:05:53.78,Main,Dina,0,0,0,,It's obvious that you'll reveal \Nyour true intentions soon enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.26,0:05:58.70,Main,Dina,0,0,0,,You're going to prepare this space.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.70,0:06:01.49,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,So we're making a new garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.49,0:06:02.60,Main,Dina,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.60,0:06:05.22,Main,Dina,0,0,0,,It's nice that the academy \Nlet us use this space,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.22,0:06:08.02,Main,Dina,0,0,0,,but it's full of weeds and the \Nsoil isn't workable yet, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.02,0:06:09.22,Main,Dina,0,0,0,,We've got a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.61,0:06:11.53,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,So is this my entrance test for the club?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.53,0:06:12.98,Main,Dina,0,0,0,,You've got one week.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.98,0:06:14.41,Main,Dina,0,0,0,,And you've got to do it all by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.41,0:06:15.55,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.55,0:06:17.20,Main,Dina,0,0,0,,Good luck, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.20,0:06:18.89,Main,Dina,0,0,0,,Not that luck will help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.55,0:06:21.46,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.46,0:06:22.46,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Shall we begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.23,0:07:13.49,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,This is looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.49,0:07:15.24,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,You've been working really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:23.01,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,This is delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.01,0:07:24.29,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.29,0:07:27.11,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,I really love these fruit sandwiches,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.11,0:07:30.08,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,so I negotiated with the school \Nso we could have them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.08,0:07:32.09,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,It's possible to do something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.09,0:07:34.91,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Well, I am the student council president.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.24,0:07:39.02,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,You're from the top three families \Nand the student council president.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.02,0:07:41.38,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,You are really amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:43.78,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,If you ever have any questions, \Nyou can come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.84,0:07:53.43,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Right, Magic Chevalier is coming up soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.43,0:07:55.27,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Magic Chevalier?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.27,0:07:59.79,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,It's a competition to find the \Nstrongest magic sword-fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.79,0:08:01.53,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,The strongest... you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.91,0:08:04.22,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,You're not going to participate?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.03,0:08:06.57,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.55,0:08:13.30,Italics,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Stare...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.82,0:08:15.43,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Rebecca?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.43,0:08:17.85,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Do you mind if I touch them a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.66,0:08:20.52,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.00,0:08:21.90,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.13,0:08:26.32,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.32,0:08:27.19,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,So hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.47,0:08:30.24,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Your biceps have an excellent \Nshape and substance!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.97,0:08:33.19,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I trained in the backwoods forests.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.19,0:08:34.58,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.88,0:08:37.48,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,This is the first time I've \Ntouched a man's muscles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.48,0:08:38.58,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,It's really educational!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:40.55,Main,Jeryl,0,0,0,,Isn't that the Withered?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.55,0:08:42.31,Main,Laquis,0,0,0,,I wonder if Lady Amelia alone is not enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.31,0:08:45.23,Main,Laquis,0,0,0,,so that's why he's trying to friendly with \NRebecca from the top three noble families.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.23,0:08:48.67,Main,Wanda,0,0,0,,Typical, perverted mindset of an ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.51,0:08:58.71,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,How did I do, Miss Sera?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.30,0:09:00.49,Main,Dina,0,0,0,,...sed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.49,0:09:01.28,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.28,0:09:02.56,Main,Dina,0,0,0,,You passed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.63,0:09:05.07,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.81,0:09:08.69,Main,Rebecca,0,0,0,,Then, let's plant some new flowers here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.96,0:09:09.85,Main,all,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.13,0:09:20.08,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,Ray. I have something I'd like you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.48,0:09:22.87,Flashback,Ray,0,0,0,,Let me have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.48,0:09:28.97,Flashback,Ray,0,0,0,,A spy from the empire inside the kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.97,0:09:30.02,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.02,0:09:32.80,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,There is a chance that even this \Nacademy has been infiltrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.80,0:09:35.28,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,The staff has already been informed as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.28,0:09:37.88,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,but if you find anything, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.35,0:09:39.59,Flashback,Ray,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.59,0:09:40.81,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.81,0:09:44.10,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,But the state of affairs in the \Nkingdom is quite messy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.10,0:09:46.83,Flashback,Abbie,0,0,0,,I'd like to resolve this \Nin secret, if possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.98,0:09:51.09,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Claris, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.85,0:09:55.17,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,Ray?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.17,0:09:58.48,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,Why would you suddenly talk to \Nme like that? You startled me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.48,0:10:00.03,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I apologize for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.03,0:10:02.86,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,But what are you doing here, \Ncrouched down like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.90,0:10:06.70,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,I was watching some pill bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.70,0:10:07.51,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Pill bugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.23,0:10:11.93,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,I know it's weird for a high-class noble \Nfamily's daughter to like insects.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.30,0:10:16.96,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,Everyone else likes dogs or cats \Nor some kind of cute animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.96,0:10:19.46,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,That's why I don't have a lot of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.46,0:10:21.84,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,But that's part of who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.84,0:10:23.49,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I think that's really fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.99,0:10:26.13,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,You don't think it's weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.13,0:10:27.11,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,I said I like bugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.46,0:10:29.32,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I like bugs too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.32,0:10:31.59,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,It is a great honor to be your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.10,0:10:33.57,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,F-friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.57,0:10:38.37,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,D-d-d-did you s-say we're f-f-friends?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.37,0:10:39.70,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.70,0:10:43.14,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Somehow it seemed like we \Ncan talk so comfortably,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.14,0:10:45.09,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,so maybe I read into it too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.09,0:10:46.59,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Did I offend you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.59,0:10:49.17,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,A friend? I've never had...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.94,0:10:51.87,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,I mean, if you want to. I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.87,0:10:53.62,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Really? That would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.08,0:10:56.74,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,All right! My very first friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.74,0:10:58.54,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,I actually made a friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.54,0:10:59.63,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.93,0:11:01.49,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,Nothing at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.49,0:11:02.46,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.46,0:11:04.47,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,The sun's already starting to go down,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.47,0:11:08.94,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,but I'd love to talk about the various \Nbugs I saw in the jungle some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.94,0:11:10.57,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,In great detail, you hear!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.57,0:11:11.64,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,Promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.64,0:11:13.34,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,It's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.34,0:11:15.93,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Besides, talking to you is a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.31,0:11:19.49,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,I guess I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.49,0:11:22.37,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,Since you insist, I'll go along with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.37,0:11:23.53,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:27.97,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.63,0:11:33.95,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Today, we'll be talking about \Nthe derivations of sorcery.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.32,0:11:36.75,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,This topic is quite technical,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.75,0:11:38.62,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,but is there anyone who \Ncan give an explanation?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.11,0:11:40.13,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Ray White.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.13,0:11:41.41,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,How about you give it a try?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.41,0:11:42.54,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.54,0:11:44.99,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Sorcery is primarily \Ncategorized as low-grade,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.99,0:11:47.39,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,mid-grade, high-grade, and holy-grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.42,0:11:51.08,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Furthermore: as quick,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.49,0:11:53.46,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,remote,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.55,0:11:56.39,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,chain,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.73,0:12:00.61,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,delay,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.99,0:12:04.17,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,material shift,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.02,0:12:07.17,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,extensive,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.35,0:12:12.16,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,extensive chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.16,0:12:15.17,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,The aforementioned are \Nthe seven derivations.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.17,0:12:17.02,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,White is absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.02,0:12:18.52,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,You've been studying hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.52,0:12:19.53,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.38,0:12:30.06,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,That is all for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.06,0:12:34.22,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Also, we'll be doing our practical \Nexercise out in the Kafka Forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.75,0:12:41.64,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,I want you to form groups \Nof four before then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.64,0:12:42.40,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,That is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.87,0:12:45.63,Main,Cusuechs,0,0,0,,Yeah! For us that's easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.63,0:12:47.00,Main,Zuina,0,0,0,,Right, Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:49.77,Main,Wanda,0,0,0,,Lady Rose, will you be in our group?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.77,0:12:51.39,Main,Laquis,0,0,0,,Please, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.39,0:12:52.49,Main,Male Student A,0,0,0,,What about being in our group?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.83,0:12:56.47,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.47,0:12:58.01,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,Let's group up, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.75,0:12:59.93,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.93,0:13:02.94,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,It's common knowledge that \NI'm not great at sorcery.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.94,0:13:04.99,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,You're good at using your body, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.99,0:13:08.58,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,Besides, a gold hunter \Nis worth 100 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.58,0:13:10.66,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Really? Well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.66,0:13:13.06,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,But what about the other spots?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.40,0:13:22.50,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,Ray?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.50,0:13:24.25,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Elisa, want to be in our group?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.27,0:13:29.91,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,But... I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.19,0:13:35.88,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,I'm happy, but I'm so physically \Nweak that I'd just be a burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.88,0:13:36.91,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Elisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.39,0:13:42.29,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Elisa, let's all do our best together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.29,0:13:43.82,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,We need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.82,0:13:45.00,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.61,0:13:47.47,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,I'll be supporting, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.04,0:13:54.09,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,Okay. Thank you. Both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.00,0:13:57.46,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Do you still have an open spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.66,0:14:05.02,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.02,0:14:07.16,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Your spot was there \Nfrom the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.82,0:14:23.92,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Let's go over the details of \Nthis drill one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.51,0:14:28.57,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,The aim of this drill is to reach the \Ngoal in the center of the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.08,0:14:33.13,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Do not forget to hit each checkpoint \Nthat are placed throughout the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.78,0:14:37.19,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,The number stamps you collect \Nwill affect your final scores.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.67,0:14:39.83,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,You have 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.83,0:14:41.49,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Anything after that will not count.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.34,0:14:47.38,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,The Kafka Forest is full of monsters that \Nthis unique environment has nurtured.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.38,0:14:49.39,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Be aware that combat will be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.15,0:14:54.74,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,This will be the first practical \Nexercise, but do not ask for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.74,0:14:56.75,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,That might lead to being held back a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.40,0:14:58.36,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,That is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.36,0:15:01.92,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,Wait at the designated area until \Nthe signal to start is given.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.70,0:15:08.06,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,I'm so nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.06,0:15:09.67,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Elisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.67,0:15:11.12,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,We're all here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.12,0:15:13.14,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,You're so kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.74,0:15:15.61,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,You don't look nervous at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.61,0:15:16.67,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.67,0:15:18.80,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,If anything, it's a nostalgic feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.80,0:15:19.88,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,Nostalgic?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.88,0:15:21.69,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I came from the middle of nowhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.69,0:15:23.89,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,so I'm used to running around \Nthe forests and the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.21,0:15:27.73,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Hey, what should we do about our order?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.73,0:15:29.57,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,Right, we haven't decided that yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.57,0:15:31.91,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Maybe Ray and you should be the vanguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.91,0:15:34.93,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,I'll be in the middle and \NElisa brings up the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.93,0:15:36.29,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,That sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.29,0:15:39.42,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,No, I'd like to take care \Nof the middle, and help out as needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.42,0:15:40.29,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.29,0:15:42.57,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I am used to these types of drills,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.57,0:15:45.59,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,so I'd like you and Evi to be the vanguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.59,0:15:50.88,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,That's fine, but what do you mean, \Nyou're used to these types of drills?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.23,0:15:53.18,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Let's just say, I learned a lot \Nin those backwoods forests.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.86,0:15:56.43,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.88,0:15:59.04,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,The practical exercise will now commence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.72,0:16:01.73,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,You all ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.73,0:16:02.47,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,Sure am!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.47,0:16:03.35,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,You bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.20,0:16:05.73,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.73,0:16:06.61,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,I will do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.04,0:16:08.98,Main,Gray,0,0,0,,The exercise begins now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.40,0:16:35.88,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Elisa, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.88,0:16:36.78,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.78,0:16:37.49,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.49,0:16:39.22,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,So this is one of those monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.69,0:16:46.90,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.90,0:16:48.67,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Split in two in one hit...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.67,0:16:50.76,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,That's amazing. Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.24,0:16:52.60,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.05,0:16:55.81,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Hey, we found a stamp!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.23,0:16:57.58,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,Slap that on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.27,0:17:00.48,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.48,0:17:01.55,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,We're doing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.21,0:17:06.86,Main,Wanda,0,0,0,,Are we even going the right way?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.86,0:17:08.59,Main,Jeryl,0,0,0,,We are, I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.59,0:17:10.25,Main,Laquis,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.13,0:17:14.99,Main,Claris,0,0,0,,That's so huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.50,0:17:23.28,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,We're making really good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.28,0:17:25.60,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,At this rate, we could \Neven make it back first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.60,0:17:27.91,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,Ray was really amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.91,0:17:28.61,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,He was.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.07,0:17:30.85,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,His battle abilities are exceptional.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.14,0:17:34.27,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,And he even has a wealth \Nof survival knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.27,0:17:36.67,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,That's what I'd expect from a gold hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.67,0:17:39.52,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I came across many a monster \Nin those backwoods forests.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.01,0:17:42.13,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,So I'm used to this kind of situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.13,0:17:44.54,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Backwoods forests, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.32,0:17:48.40,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,She's doubting the "Universally applicable \Ntheorem of the backwoods forest"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.40,0:17:50.28,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Master, you promised something else...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.25,0:17:53.09,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,You're something different, huh Ray?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.09,0:17:55.39,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,So are you, for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.39,0:17:57.08,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,I would've never expected the eldest daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.08,0:17:58.81,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,of the Rose family to align \Nherself with an ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.81,0:18:00.30,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,It's beyond weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.30,0:18:04.09,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,I don't like that bloodline and class stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.09,0:18:06.80,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,The Rose family is the leader of the \Nthree big noble families, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.80,0:18:08.09,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Aren't you proud of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.95,0:18:11.16,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,I hate all of that formality.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.07,0:18:15.56,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,I mean, I've put in so much effort \Nto become who I am right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.40,0:18:17.82,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,Amelia?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.82,0:18:20.38,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.38,0:18:24.13,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,I'm really enjoying hanging out with \Nyou because you interact with me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.13,0:18:25.68,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,without all that formality.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.68,0:18:28.83,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,I'm also happy that we're \Ngetting to know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.94,0:18:33.49,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,You really are too cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.37,0:18:37.00,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Cute all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.84,0:18:38.85,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,Amelia, this is getting weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.98,0:18:40.09,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,We're counting on you, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.08,0:18:43.58,Flashback,Derek,0,0,0,,We're counting on you, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.16,0:18:47.31,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Compared to the battlefield,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.31,0:18:49.06,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,this forest is heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.05,0:18:55.36,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Is it really okay for me to be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.01,0:18:59.35,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Do I have the right to \Nenjoy this kind of life?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.76,0:19:00.77,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Ray?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.53,0:19:03.88,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.37,0:19:08.50,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.50,0:19:10.17,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Let's get ready for tomorrow and go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.45,0:19:28.80,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,Ray, I won't tell you to keep your \Nidentity hidden at all costs forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.31,0:19:32.18,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,But your situation is quite special.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.18,0:19:34.77,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,If you want to enjoy a \Nnormal life at school,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.77,0:19:37.15,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,it will be probably best to \Ntry to keep it under wraps.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.12,0:19:43.25,Main,Lydia,0,0,0,,However, if you ever find some friends \Nthat you can absolutely trust...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.21,0:19:46.57,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.10,0:19:48.24,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.74,0:19:55.64,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.64,0:19:56.86,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,A scream?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.69,0:19:58.61,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.61,0:19:59.41,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Ray, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.41,0:20:00.88,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I'm going ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.28,0:20:07.65,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,That scream just now. I have a bad feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.35,0:20:15.84,Main,Cusuechs,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.84,0:20:17.35,Main,Zuina,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.35,0:20:18.94,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,D-Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.94,0:20:20.05,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.05,0:20:21.23,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Mister Alium!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.23,0:20:22.59,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Allow me to assist!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.40,0:20:24.54,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Withered?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.91,0:20:26.85,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Inside code, inertial control!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.37,0:20:31.24,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,How is he moving like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.51,0:20:55.93,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Can you stand, Mister Alium?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.09,0:21:00.24,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,Don't you dare look down on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.54,0:21:02.75,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,You're just an ordinary!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.75,0:21:04.90,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,I could've done that all by myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.28,0:21:06.72,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.72,0:21:07.91,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Did you have some kind of secret strategy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.05,0:21:10.82,Main,Albert,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.82,0:21:11.79,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.73,0:21:16.08,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.08,0:21:17.61,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,What a huge monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.61,0:21:20.50,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Mister Alium's party got attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.11,0:21:24.29,Main,Cusuechs,0,0,0,,Will you hurry up and get us down from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.60,0:21:26.43,Main,Zuina,0,0,0,,This hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.43,0:21:27.97,Main,Zuina,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.97,0:21:31.05,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Elisa, could I ask you to look after them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.05,0:21:33.05,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,Yes, I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.05,0:21:34.32,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,I'll help, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.99,0:21:39.16,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Did you defeat that by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.62,0:21:41.57,Main,Ray,0,0,0,,Yes, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.48,0:21:44.73,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Ray... who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.76,0:22:03.08,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,Hey, hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.02,0:22:05.04,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,This can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.04,0:22:06.37,Main,Amelia,0,0,0,,Wha...
