Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.11,0:23:52.26,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,Hey! It's the preview for the next episode
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.26,0:23:55.00,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,of "The Iceblade Sorcerer \NShall Rule the World"!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.00,0:23:57.07,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,Ray faces off against this massive monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.07,0:24:01.97,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,Can he defeat it and finish this \Ninsane practical exercise in one piece?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.97,0:24:06.07,Main,Evi,0,0,0,,The boy who became the world's \Nstrongest sorcerer enjoys a day off!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.50,0:24:10.00,ep title,txt,0,0,0,,Episode 3\N{\fscx95}The Boy Who Became the World's \NStrongest Sorcerer Enjoys a Day Off
